      "message": "These strike me as API contract or similar API qualifiers / decorators, where as the one below relate to API inclusion/restriction.\n\nMaybe something around \"qualifier\" or \"decoration\" would make it clear.\n\nUnless we change this we end up with:\n\nannotations_dir\nvisibility_annotations_dir \n\nand without better naming or documentation it\u0027s inviting the question \"what\u0027s the difference?\", \"what\u0027s a visibility annotation and how is it different from an api annotation?\" and \"when would I use one over the other\". If we can\u0027t come up with a good name, then document them more fully.",
